UK", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18268, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01NQf5cE3znRcM84Dv83x4Kc", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: (1) Identified v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production (v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and unhealthy). (2) Ran rollback to v2.3.0. The first attempt halted partway with an orchestrator error after us-east, leaving the service mixed (us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). (3) Retried the rollback to v2.3.0; it completed in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west all on v2.3.0). Current status: healthy, error rate 0.002. Follow-ups: investigate the v2.3.1 regression and the orchestrator partial failure during the first rollback attempt; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed without fixing and validating it."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 48868, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01NQf5cE3znRcM84Dv83x4Kc", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 48868, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NQf5cE3znRcM84Dv83x4Kc", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49998, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_013qiirjKKbzueaHiTUanXhY", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 50298, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_013qiirjKKbzueaHiTUanXhY", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50298, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_013qiirjKKbzueaHiTUanXhY", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 52657, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "`checkout-api` is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and is healthy again, with error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\n- **Target version:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only ever in staging.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback once, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as SEV2 for checkout-api. The first incident-creation call timed out, so I checked the incident list before anything else. It had been created, so I did not open a duplicate.\n\nThe incident notes list two follow-ups: the v2.3.1 regression needs investigating, and the orchestrator partial failure during the first rollback attempt should be looked at. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed and validated.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_016CAxJdKA6wNRotNm8Yhu5K", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012rgqQBhmPSJ6kaJ1LCvCuB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0 